-- CAPABILITY ----------- errors/scoped_misplaced_1.march

`scoped` marks the handle a callback receives, so it is written only before the parameter type of a function type that is itself a function's parameter, as in `fn with_open(path : String, body : scoped File.Handle -> r)`. [scoped_misplaced]

